  "description": "ZendoVR is a walking meditation in the woods.\nThe player is led along a set path in the woods and around some ponds for about 32 minutes. \nAt intervals the walking stops and a though about meditation is presented.\n\nOne can stop (down arrow key) any time and just sit and meditate. Find your favorite place.\n\nYou can control time of day, music, sounds, dialog, walking speed, and graphics detail.\nControlsWhyI wrote ZendoVR in 2016 as an idea I had for VR and meditation. It is what I wanted in a VR experience.\nI hope you all enjoy it as much as I do.\n\nMany thanks to Gil Fronsdale. I am a follower though we have never met.",
